%
% Backward goal: recursive transitive ancestor (AC-1 tabled recursion).
% Resolves ex:ancestor(ex:a, Y) over the parentOf chain a→b→c→d.
% Expected: bindings Y={b,c,d}, status ok.
:- prefix(ex, 'https://example.org/profiles/goal-recursive-ancestor/').
ex:ancestor(X,Y) :- ex:parentOf(X,Y).
ex:ancestor(X,Y) :- ex:parentOf(X,Z), ex:ancestor(Z,Y).
?- ex:ancestor(ex:a, Y).
